{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"verdan_market_walk","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":2,"title":"The Price","title_ko":"가격"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_market_walk/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_memory_market.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":6,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"The market sprawled like a wound that refused to close.","text_ko":"시장은 아물기를 거부하는 상처처럼 펼쳐져 있었다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_market_walk/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/chapter_expansion/ch02_bottled_memories_market_v1.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":6,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Stalls selling things that shouldn't exist, bottled laughter, crystallized grief, a child's first word trapped in resin and going for forty Grains.","text_ko":"존재해서는 안 되는 것들을 파는 노점상. 병에 담긴 웃음, 결정화된 슬픔, 송진에 갇힌 아이의 첫 마디, 그리고 40곡을 사들이는 것."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_market_walk/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":6,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"Don't stare.","text_ko":"쳐다보지 마."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_market_walk/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":6,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"They're selling memories.","text_ko":"기억을 팔고 있어."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_market_walk/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":6,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"Of course they are. What else is there to sell? Look around, there are no farms, no factories. The only currency that matters here is what you've lost.","text_ko":"당연하지. 팔 게 그것 말고 뭐가 있겠어? 둘러봐, 농장도, 공장도 없어. 여기서 통하는 유일한 화폐는 잃어버린 것들이야."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_market_walk/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":6,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"A woman at a nearby stall held up a vial of something golden. Her sign read: MOTHER'S LOVE, GRADE 3, SLIGHTLY USED.","text_ko":"근처 좌판의 여자가 금빛 액체가 든 약병을 들어 보였다. 팻말에는 이렇게 적혀 있었다: 어머니의 사랑, 3등급, 사용감 약간."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_market_walk/6","jump":null,"original_index":6,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":6,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":6,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":6,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"Who buys someone else's mother?","text_ko":"남의 어머니를 누가 사지?"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/verdan_market_walk/7","jump":null,"original_index":7,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_concern"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":6,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":7,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":7,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"Someone who burned their own.","text_ko":"자기 어머니를 태운 사람."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"a991450a03221e40f68842fd27c31d71c4314e5a1c73d75c0cff4dcf9d657cb2","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21"},{"path":"scri